# Same concentration, larger portion: conductivity is intensive
register lv2
add v1 water 250mL
add v1 NaCl 0.001mol
measure v1 conductivity
new
add v2 water 500mL
add v2 NaCl 0.002mol
measure v2 conductivity
new
add v3 water 750mL
add v3 NaCl 0.003mol
measure v3 conductivity
new
add v4 water 1000mL
add v4 NaCl 0.004mol
measure v4 conductivity
# Water and salt scale together, so concentration stays fixed. Real readings
# also depend on cell constant, calibration, polarisation and temperature.
